# Backend adapter switch.
#   set (e.g. /api)  -> the app talks to the FastAPI backend (login, projects,
#                       characters, generate/job/pages/pdf). Same-origin `/api`
#                       is correct in production (the SPA is served by FastAPI).
#   empty/unset      -> local-first fallback: projects live in browser storage
#                       and login just captures a local profile.
VITE_API_URL=/api
